 pected\, not yet official)\nSee your exact ballot at https://my.arizona.vo
 te\n\nYour checklist:\n☐ Check that you're registered: https://my.arizon
 a.vote\n☐ Moved? Update your address by October 4 (date expected)\n☐ W
 ant to vote by mail? Request an early ballot by October 22 (date expected)
 \, or join the Active Early Voting List to get one every election: https:/
 /recorder.maricopa.gov\n☐ See who and what is on your ballot: https://my
 .arizona.vote\n☐ Learn about the candidates and measures in the Clean El
 ections voter guide: https://www.azcleanelections.gov\n☐ Decide how and 
 when you'll vote\n\nWant help? https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20re
 ady%20for%20the%20Maricopa%20County%20jurisdictional%20election%20on%20202
 7-11-02.%20I%20live%20in%20Tempe.\n\nCity info: https://www.tempe.gov/gove
 rnment/city-clerk-s-office/election-information\nCheck your registration: 
