DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20281107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20281108
SUMMARY:Election day: 2028 general election
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- School district: School board seats and any d
 istrict bond or override measures (expected\, not yet official)\n- County:
  County offices in every county (supervisors\, recorder\, sheriff\, county
  attorney\, assessor\, treasurer\, school superintendent)\n- State: All 90
  state legislature seats\n- State: Three Corporation Commission seats\n- S
 tate: Statewide ballot measures\, if any qualify (expected\, not yet offic
 ial)\n- Federal: President\n- Federal: U.S. Senate (the seat Mark Kelly ho
 lds)\n- Federal: All nine U.S. House seats\nSee your exact ballot at https
 ://my.arizona.vote\n\nPolls are open 6 a.m. to 7 p.m. If you're in line by
  7 p.m.\, you can still vote.\nYour checklist:\n☐ Find where to vote thr
 ough Maricopa County elections: https://elections.maricopa.gov\n☐ Voting
  in person? Bring an ID\, like a driver's license or tribal ID\n☐ Still 
 have your early ballot? Drop it off at any voting location by 7 p.m.\n\nNe
 ed a plan? https://chatgpt.com/?q=It%27s%20almost%20election%20day%20for%2
 0the%20General%20election.%20Help%20me%20finish%20my%20plan%20to%20vote.%2
 0I%20live%20in%20Tempe.\n\nCity info: https://www.tempe.gov/government/cit
 y-clerk-s-office/election-information\nCheck your registration: https://my
 .arizona.vote
URL:https://elections.maricopa.gov
